reply:
```turtle
@prefix ea:   <http://example.org/onto/assessment#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

<http://example.org/onto/assessment> a owl:Ontology ;
  rdfs:comment "Ontology of educational assessment built from a corpus on educational assessment, testing, validity and reliability. Where the corpus presents a classification axis (e.g. purpose, reference type, standardization, stakes), the axis is reified as a functional object property with a disjoint value-partition class, and named kinds are defined as equivalentClass bridges. The corpus explicitly states that a single test can belong to several of these axes at once ('Most tests can be classified on multiple categories'), so axes are kept independent of one another; disjointness is only asserted *within* an axis or within an explicitly enumerated coordinate list. Where the corpus contradicts itself (treating a kind as a coordinate sibling in one passage and as a subordinate/species in another), both axioms are asserted and the tension is flagged in an rdfs:comment, as required." .

#################################################################
# TOP-LEVEL CLASSES
#################################################################

ea:Assessment a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:label "Assessment" ;
  skos:altLabel "educational evaluation" ;
  rdfs:comment "The systematic process of documenting and using empirical data on knowledge, skill, attitudes, aptitude and beliefs to refine programs and improve student learning." .

ea:Test a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
  skos:altLabel "examination", "exam", "evaluation" ;
  rdfs:comment "An educational assessment intended to measure a test-taker's knowledge, skill, aptitude, physical fitness, or classification in other topics." .

ea:TestItem a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:comment "A component question/prompt of a test; the general term preferred over 'question' because items need not be phrased as questions." .

ea:Rubric a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:comment "A scoring guide used to evaluate the quality of students' constructed responses (Popham)." .

ea:AssessmentQuality a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:comment "Parent class for quality attributes of an assessment (validity, reliability)." .

ea:Validity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AssessmentQuality .
ea:Reliability a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AssessmentQuality .

ea:LearningOutcome a owl:Class .
ea:GradingApproach a owl:Class .
ea:Learning a owl:Class .
ea:Feedback a owl:Class .
ea:StudentPortfolio a owl:Class .
ea:NormGroup a owl:Class ;
  skos:altLabel "norming group", "reference group" ;
  rdfs:comment "Sample drawn from a predefined population used to derive norm-referenced score interpretations." .
ea:CompetencyBasedLearning a owl:Class ;
  skos:altLabel "proficiency-based learning", "mastery-based learning", "outcome-based learning", "performance-based learning (instructional system sense)", "standards-based learning" ;
  rdfs:comment "Systems of instruction, assessment, grading and reporting based on students demonstrating learned knowledge/skills." .
ea:Proficiency a owl:Class .
ea:MeasurementError a owl:Class .
ea:ScoreInflation a owl:Class ;
  rdfs:comment "Increase in scores that does not reflect genuine improvement in learning." .
ea:TeacherEvaluationMeasure a owl:Class .

#################################################################
# OBJECT / DATATYPE PROPERTIES (general)
#################################################################

ea:hasItem a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range ea:TestItem .
ea:isItemOf a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  owl:inverseOf ea:hasItem ;
  rdfs:domain ea:TestItem ; rdfs:range ea:Test .

ea:hasRubric a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:Rubric .

ea:hasLearningOutcome a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:LearningOutcome .

ea:hasValidity a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:Validity .

ea:hasReliability a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:Reliability .

ea:hasComponent a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:Assessment ;
  rdfs:comment "Used e.g. to state that continuous assessment includes formative assessment as a component." .

ea:hasNormGroup a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range ea:NormGroup .

ea:hasStem a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:TestItem ; rdfs:range xsd:string .

ea:hasItemCount a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range xsd:integer .

ea:hasCutScore a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

ea:hasReliabilityCoefficient a owl:DatatypeProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Reliability ; rdfs:range xsd:decimal .

#################################################################
# AXIS 1: GRANULARITY
# "Assessment can focus on the individual learner, the learning community
#  ..., a course, an academic program, the institution, or the educational
#  system as a whole (also known as granularity)."
#################################################################

ea:hasGranularity a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:GranularityCategory .

ea:GranularityCategory a owl:Class .
ea:LearnerGranularity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:GranularityCategory .
ea:LearningCommunityGranularity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:GranularityCategory .
ea:CourseGranularity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:GranularityCategory .
ea:ProgramGranularity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:GranularityCategory .
ea:InstitutionGranularity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:GranularityCategory .
ea:EducationalSystemGranularity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:GranularityCategory .

ea:GranularityCategory owl:disjointUnionOf
  ( ea:LearnerGranularity ea:LearningCommunityGranularity ea:CourseGranularity
    ea:ProgramGranularity ea:InstitutionGranularity ea:EducationalSystemGranularity ) .

#################################################################
# AXIS 2: PURPOSE / TIMING  (placement, formative, summative, diagnostic)
#################################################################

ea:hasPurpose a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:PurposeCategory .

ea:PurposeCategory a owl:Class .
ea:PlacementPurpose a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PurposeCategory .
ea:FormativePurpose a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PurposeCategory .
ea:SummativePurpose a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PurposeCategory .
ea:DiagnosticPurpose a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PurposeCategory .

ea:PurposeCategory owl:disjointUnionOf
  ( ea:PlacementPurpose ea:FormativePurpose ea:SummativePurpose ea:DiagnosticPurpose ) .

ea:PlacementAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasPurpose ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:PlacementPurpose ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "pre-assessment", "initial assessment", "threshold knowledge test", "TKT" ;
  rdfs:comment "Used to place students according to prior achievement or characteristics; conducted before instruction; generally not graded." .

ea:FormativeAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasPurpose ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:FormativePurpose ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "formative evaluation", "formative feedback", "assessment for learning",
                "educative assessment", "classroom assessment" ;
  rdfs:comment "Conducted throughout a course to provide feedback and inform teaching; generally not used for grading. The corpus explicitly includes 'diagnostic testing' within the definition of formative assessment ('Formative assessment, formative evaluation, ... including diagnostic testing')." .

ea:SummativeAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasPurpose ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:SummativePurpose ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "summative evaluation", "assessment of learning" ;
  rdfs:comment "Conducted at the end of a course/project to assign a grade and evaluate learning outcomes." .

ea:DiagnosticAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasPurpose ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:DiagnosticPurpose ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "diagnostic testing" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormativeAssessment ;
  rdfs:comment "TENSION: one passage lists diagnostic assessment as the 4th coordinate category alongside placement/formative/summative ('Assessment is often divided into initial, formative and summative... (4) Diagnostic assessment'), implying it is disjoint from FormativeAssessment via hasPurpose (PurposeCategory is a disjoint union). Another passage states 'A common form of formative assessment is diagnostic assessment', which is modeled here as rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormativeAssessment. Both axioms are asserted as required, even though jointly with the disjoint-union axis they produce a tension (a DiagnosticAssessment would need hasPurpose values of two disjoint categories)." .

ea:ForwardLookingAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
  rdfs:comment "Asks those being assessed to consider themselves in hypothetical future situations." .

ea:SelfAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:DiagnosticAssessment ;
  rdfs:comment "A form of diagnostic assessment in which students assess themselves." .

ea:PeerAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment .

#################################################################
# AXIS 3: OBJECTIVE / SUBJECTIVE  (response format, at Assessment level)
#################################################################

ea:hasResponseFormat a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:ResponseFormatCategory .

ea:ResponseFormatCategory a owl:Class .
ea:ObjectiveFormat a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ResponseFormatCategory .
ea:SubjectiveFormat a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ResponseFormatCategory .
ea:ResponseFormatCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:ObjectiveFormat ea:SubjectiveFormat ) .

ea:ObjectiveAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasResponseFormat ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:ObjectiveFormat ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "A form of questioning that has a single correct answer." .

ea:SubjectiveAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasResponseFormat ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:SubjectiveFormat ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "A form of questioning that may have more than one correct answer or way of expressing it." .

#################################################################
# AXIS 4: REFERENCING  (criterion / norm / ipsative)
#################################################################

ea:hasReferenceType a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:ReferenceCategory .

ea:ReferenceCategory a owl:Class .
ea:CriterionReference a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReferenceCategory .
ea:NormReference a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReferenceCategory .
ea:IpsativeReference a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ReferenceCategory .
ea:ReferenceCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:CriterionReference ea:NormReference ea:IpsativeReference ) .

ea:CriterionReferencedAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasReferenceType ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:CriterionReference ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "standards-based assessment" ;
  rdfs:comment "Candidates are measured against defined, objective criteria (e.g. the driving test)." .

ea:NormReferencedAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasReferenceType ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:NormReference ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "grading on the curve", "normative assessment" ;
  rdfs:comment "Performance is relative to the student body taking the test (e.g. the IQ test)." .

ea:IpsativeAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasReferenceType ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:IpsativeReference ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Self-comparison either over time in the same domain, or across domains within the same student." .

ea:CriterionReferencedTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasReferenceType ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:CriterionReference ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "CRT", "mastery test" .

ea:NormReferencedTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasReferenceType ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:NormReference ] ) ] ;
  skos:altLabel "NRT" .

#################################################################
# AXIS 5: FORMAL / INFORMAL
#################################################################

ea:hasFormality a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:FormalityCategory .

ea:FormalityCategory a owl:Class .
ea:FormalCategory a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormalityCategory .
ea:InformalCategory a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormalityCategory .
ea:FormalityCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:FormalCategory ea:InformalCategory ) .

ea:FormalAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasFormality ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:FormalCategory ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Usually implies a written document and is given a numerical score or grade." .

ea:InformalAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasFormality ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:InformalCategory ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Does not contribute to a student's final grade; e.g. observation, checklists, rubrics." .

#################################################################
# AXIS 6: INTERNAL / EXTERNAL
#################################################################

ea:hasAdministrationScope a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Assessment ; rdfs:range ea:AdministrationScopeCategory .

ea:AdministrationScopeCategory a owl:Class .
ea:InternalScope a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AdministrationScopeCategory .
ea:ExternalScope a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AdministrationScopeCategory .
ea:AdministrationScopeCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:InternalScope ea:ExternalScope ) .

ea:InternalAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasAdministrationScope ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:InternalScope ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Set and marked by the school." .

ea:ExternalAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Assessment
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasAdministrationScope ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:ExternalScope ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Set by the governing body and marked by unbiased personnel." .

#################################################################
# AXIS 7: STANDARDIZATION (Test level)
#################################################################

ea:hasStandardizationStatus a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range ea:StandardizationCategory .

ea:StandardizationCategory a owl:Class .
ea:StandardizedCategory a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizationCategory .
ea:NonStandardizedCategory a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizationCategory .
ea:StandardizationCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:StandardizedCategory ea:NonStandardizedCategory ) .

ea:StandardizedTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasStandardizationStatus ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:StandardizedCategory ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Administered and scored in a consistent, standard manner for all test takers." .

ea:NonStandardizedTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasStandardizationStatus ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:NonStandardizedCategory ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Flexible in scope and format, variable in difficulty across test takers." .

# representative examples of standardized tests (coordinate list -> treated as disjoint siblings)
ea:AchievementTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizedTest .
ea:AptitudeTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizedTest .
ea:CollegeAdmissionsTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizedTest .
ea:InternationalComparisonTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizedTest .
ea:PsychologicalTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StandardizedTest .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
  owl:members ( ea:AchievementTest ea:AptitudeTest ea:CollegeAdmissionsTest
                ea:InternationalComparisonTest ea:PsychologicalTest ) .

#################################################################
# AXIS 8: STAKES
#################################################################

ea:hasStakesLevel a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range ea:StakesLevelCategory .

ea:StakesLevelCategory a owl:Class .
ea:HighStakesCategory a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StakesLevelCategory .
ea:LowStakesCategory a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:StakesLevelCategory .
ea:StakesLevelCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:HighStakesCategory ea:LowStakesCategory ) .

ea:HighStakesTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasStakesLevel ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:HighStakesCategory ] ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "A test with a desired reward or important consequence for performance." .

ea:LowStakesTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasStakesLevel ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:LowStakesCategory ] ) ] .

ea:CompetitiveExamination a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:NormReferencedTest ea:HighStakesTest ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Norm-referenced, high-stakes tests in which candidates are ranked and top rankers selected." .

#################################################################
# AXIS 9: ADMINISTRATION MODE
#################################################################

ea:hasAdministrationMode a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range ea:AdministrationModeCategory .

ea:AdministrationModeCategory a owl:Class .
ea:WrittenMode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AdministrationModeCategory .
ea:OralMode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AdministrationModeCategory .
ea:PracticalMode a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:AdministrationModeCategory .
ea:AdministrationModeCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:WrittenMode ea:OralMode ea:PracticalMode ) .

ea:WrittenTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasAdministrationMode ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:WrittenMode ] ) ] .
ea:OralTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasAdministrationMode ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:OralMode ] ) ] .
ea:PracticalTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasAdministrationMode ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:PracticalMode ] ) ] .

#################################################################
# PERFORMANCE-BASED / AUTHENTIC ASSESSMENT
#################################################################

ea:PerformanceBasedAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
  rdfs:comment "Requires students to solve real-world problems or produce something with real-world application; similar to summative assessment in that it focuses on achievement." .

ea:hasPerformanceFormat a owl:ObjectProperty, owl:FunctionalProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:PerformanceBasedAssessment ; rdfs:range ea:PerformanceFormatCategory .

ea:PerformanceFormatCategory a owl:Class .
ea:ProductOutcome a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PerformanceFormatCategory .
ea:LivePerformanceOutcome a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PerformanceFormatCategory .
ea:PerformanceFormatCategory owl:disjointUnionOf ( ea:ProductOutcome ea:LivePerformanceOutcome ) .

ea:AuthenticAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass ea:PerformanceBasedAssessment ;
  rdfs:comment "Corpus states 'Performance assessments may also be called authentic assessments', modeled as equivalentClass. A separate passage independently defines authentic assessment as 'measurement of accomplishments within a realistic, practical context relevant outside of the school setting', which is compatible but given as an independent genus+differentia definition." .

ea:ComplexAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
  rdfs:comment "Requires a rubric and an expert examiner, e.g. a thesis or funding proposal." .

ea:ContinuousAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
  rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasComponent ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:FormativeAssessment ] ;
  rdfs:comment "Evaluates progress throughout a course; 'will often include some form of formative assessment'." .

#################################################################
# ASSESSMENT-BY-USAGE CATEGORIES (Glossary of Education Reform list)
#################################################################

ea:InterimAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment ;
  skos:altLabel "benchmark assessment" ;
  rdfs:comment "Periodic assessment to check whether students are on track for future summative assessments. TENSION: 'Some educators consider interim tests to be formative... but others may consider them to be summative.' Both FormativeAssessment and SummativeAssessment overlaps are therefore left unresolved/possible rather than asserting one." .

ea:ScreeningAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment .
ea:CommonAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment .
ea:PortfolioBasedAssessment a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Assessment .
ea:StandardsBasedAssessment a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass ea:CriterionReferencedAssessment .

[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
  owl:members ( ea:HighStakesTest ea:PlacementAssessment ea:FormativeAssessment
                ea:SummativeAssessment ea:InterimAssessment ea:ScreeningAssessment ) .

#################################################################
# TEST ITEM TAXONOMY
#################################################################

ea:SelectionItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:TestItem ;
  rdfs:comment "Closed-ended item: the test taker selects from a pre-determined list of answers." .
ea:ConstructedResponseItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:TestItem ;
  rdfs:comment "Open-ended item requiring the test taker to produce a response." .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ; owl:members ( ea:SelectionItem ea:ConstructedResponseItem ) .

ea:MultipleChoiceItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:SelectionItem ;
  skos:altLabel "MCQ", "multiple choice question", "objective response" ;
  rdfs:comment "Consists of a stem and alternatives; exactly one option is keyed correct (the key); incorrect options are distractors." .
ea:MultipleResponseItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:SelectionItem ;
  rdfs:comment "More than one answer may be keyed as correct, contrasted with ea:MultipleChoiceItem." .
ea:TrueFalseItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:SelectionItem .
ea:MatchingItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:SelectionItem .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
  owl:members ( ea:MultipleChoiceItem ea:MultipleResponseItem ea:TrueFalseItem ea:MatchingItem ) .

ea:TrueFalseFamily a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:MultipleChoiceItem ;
  rdfs:comment "TENSION: a later passage states there are 'two families of multiple-choice questions': a True/False family (choose all appropriate answers) and a One-Best-Answer family, making True/False a *subordinate* species of multiple-choice. This conflicts with the earlier, coordinate listing of 'true/false, multiple-choice, multiple-response, and matching' as sibling, disjoint objective question types (see ea:TrueFalseItem, disjoint from ea:MultipleChoiceItem). Both axioms are retained." .
ea:OneBestAnswerFamily a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:MultipleChoiceItem ;
  rdfs:comment "Requires the test taker to answer only one from a list of answers." .

ea:ExtendedResponseItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructedResponseItem .
ea:EssayItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructedResponseItem ;
  skos:altLabel "free response question", "FRQ", "essay question" ;
  rdfs:comment "'A free response question (FRQ) or essay question is a type of open-ended question' — modeled as a single class with these as synonyms." .
ea:ShortAnswerItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructedResponseItem .
ea:FillInTheBlankItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructedResponseItem .
ea:WordBankFillInTheBlankItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:FillInTheBlankItem .
ea:NoWordBankFillInTheBlankItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:FillInTheBlankItem ;
  rdfs:comment "Hardest variant: no word bank is provided." .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ; owl:members ( ea:ExtendedResponseItem ea:EssayItem ) .
ea:CalculationItem a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructedResponseItem ;
  rdfs:comment "Mathematics/science/economics style item requiring a freehand numerical response." .

ea:MultipleChoiceTest a owl:Class ;
  owl:equivalentClass [ owl:intersectionOf ( ea:Test
      [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty ea:hasItem ; owl:someValuesFrom ea:MultipleChoiceItem ] ) ] .

ea:PerformanceTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test ;
  rdfs:comment "Requires an examinee to actually perform a task or activity rather than answer about it." .
ea:SimulationTest a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:PerformanceTest ;
  rdfs:comment "Some performance tests are simulations." .

ea:Quiz a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:FormativeAssessment, ea:Test ;
  rdfs:comment "A brief assessment covering a small amount of material; usually formative." .

ea:MidtermExam a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Test ;
  rdfs:subClassOf [ owl:unionOf ( ea:FormativeAssessment ea:SummativeAssessment ) ] ;
  rdfs:comment "An exam given near the middle of a term; 'a type of formative or summative assessment'." .

ea:FinalExam a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:SummativeAssessment, ea:Test .

#################################################################
# SCORE INTERPRETATION
#################################################################

ea:ScoreInterpretation a owl:Class .
ea:NormReferencedScoreInterpretation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ScoreInterpretation .
ea:CriterionReferencedScoreInterpretation a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ScoreInterpretation .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
  owl:members ( ea:NormReferencedScoreInterpretation ea:CriterionReferencedScoreInterpretation ) .

ea:hasScoreInterpretation a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain ea:Test ; rdfs:range ea:ScoreInterpretation .

#################################################################
# VALIDITY
#################################################################

ea:ContentValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity ;
  skos:altLabel "logical validity" .
ea:CriterionValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity .
ea:ConstructValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity .
ea:FaceValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity .
ea:ConsequentialValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity .

[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ;
  owl:members ( ea:ContentValidity ea:CriterionValidity ea:ConstructValidity
                ea:FaceValidity ea:ConsequentialValidity ) .

ea:ContentValidity rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructValidity .
ea:CriterionValidity rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructValidity .
# TENSION note placed on ConstructValidity itself:
ea:ConstructValidity rdfs:comment "One passage lists content/criterion/construct validity (plus consequential and face) as coordinate categories of evidence (modeled above as pairwise disjoint siblings). Another passage states construct validity 'subsumes all other types of validity' and that 'modern validity theory defines construct validity as the overarching concern of validity research, subsuming all other types of validity evidence such as content validity and criterion validity' — modeled here additionally as ea:ContentValidity and ea:CriterionValidity being rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructValidity. Both the disjointness and the subsumption are asserted, producing an intentional tension." .

ea:SubjectMatterValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity ;
  rdfs:comment "Predicts the score a student would get on a similar test with different questions; widely used in education." .
ea:PredictiveTestValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Validity ;
  rdfs:comment "Predicts workplace performance; widely used in the workplace. Distinct from ea:PredictiveValidity (the criterion-validity subtype) though closely related in name." .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ; owl:members ( ea:SubjectMatterValidity ea:PredictiveTestValidity ) .

ea:ConcurrentValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:CriterionValidity ;
  rdfs:comment "Comparison between the measure and an outcome assessed at the same time." .
ea:PredictiveValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:CriterionValidity ;
  rdfs:comment "Comparison between the measure and an outcome assessed at a later time." .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ; owl:members ( ea:ConcurrentValidity ea:PredictiveValidity ) .

ea:ConvergentValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructValidity .
ea:DiscriminantValidity a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:ConstructValidity .
[] a owl:AllDisjointClasses ; owl:members ( ea:ConvergentValidity ea:DiscriminantValidity ) .

#################################################################
# RELIABILITY
#################################################################

# "several general classes of reliability estimates"
ea:InterRaterReliability a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ea:Reliability .
